- Always use components and styles from the projects design system package. documentatio can be found here: /Users/tylerdavidson/Development/float-prototype-library/docs/design-system
- always use the semantic styles defined by the comprehensive color system. Rather than using something like red-50, you should always attemtpt to find a semantic value based on the context. For text, use the text-[semantic value], or for a foreground element use the fg-[semantic value], etc. Please check the documentation if you do not understand what to do
